# Run r1102b slice 5, group B boot 1: fresh normal world (prep_srv.sh OUT s5b B spawn-animals=true spawn-monsters=true
# difficulty=normal; seed 8675309). Rows SQ-PSD-06, -07, SQ-PSM-08, -09, -03, -05, -04, -02, SQ-PSM-06a/-07a (locate
# the struck and the lone monument without loading them, save, stop: s5_B2.qb visits them after the restart).
# /locate of a meta structure can run for a long time and cannot be cancelled (gotchas.md): the meta rows are last; if
# one hangs past its waitlog, stop the server (kill after the save line) and go on with s5_B2.qb only if PSM-06a/-07a
# captured. Locate results are captured into vars (RES/vars.json), so s5_B2.qb reuses them.
# Home: spawn marker s5bhome (capture S5B). Never probe ungenerated chunks from KubeJS: forceload first (vanilla).
pace 2

## S5B-00 | setup: home marker, clock (not a queue row)
bootexpect Done \(
> execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=s5bhome] run summon minecraft:marker ~ ~ ~ {Tags:["s5bhome"]}
sleep 2
> data get entity @e[type=minecraft:marker,tag=s5bhome,limit=1] Pos
capture S5B entity data: \[(-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d, (-?\d+)\.\d+d\]
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> time set noon
> gamerule doWeatherCycle false
> weather clear 1000000
shell df -h / | tail -1
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|does not (have|accept)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|No player was found|no such bot|no such item|Invalid (block state|tag)|\[(zq|s5)\] (error|no player))

## SQ-PSD-06 | village farms (minecraft:village_savanna, dry 1 of 3): cotton possible, never peppers or coffee
> locate structure minecraft:village_savanna
waitlog (The nearest minecraft:village_savanna is at|Could not find) 600
capture S5V1 The nearest minecraft:village_savanna is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {S5V11-48} {S5V13-48} {S5V11+48} {S5V13+48}
sleep 10
> zq count {S5V11-48} 50 {S5V13-48} {S5V11+48} 130 {S5V13+48} rusticdelight:cotton
> say PSD06 dry0 rusticdelight:cotton counted
waitlog PSD06 dry0 rusticdelight:cotton counted 240
