## SQ-PSM-08 | giant squid flees a whale at 12 blocks, not at 30
> locate biome minecraft:deep_ocean
waitlog (The nearest minecraft:deep_ocean is at|Could not find) 600
capture S5O The nearest minecraft:deep_ocean is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> forceload add {S5O1-48} {S5O3-48} {S5O1+48} {S5O3+48}
sleep 10
shell grep -n '^\[giant_squid\]' -A4 config/creativecompat-common.toml
> summon alexsmobs:giant_squid {S5O1} 45 {S5O3} {PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["s5gs"]}
> summon alexsmobs:cachalot_whale {S5O1+30} 45 {S5O3} {NoAI:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["s5wh"]}
sleep 1
> data get entity @e[tag=s5gs,limit=1] Pos
capture S5Q0 entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
sleep 10
> data get entity @e[tag=s5gs,limit=1] Pos
capture S5Q1 entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> data get entity @e[tag=s5wh,limit=1] Pos
capture S5WA entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> execute as @e[tag=s5wh] at @e[tag=s5gs,limit=1] run tp @s ~12 ~ ~
sleep 5
> data get entity @e[tag=s5gs,limit=1] Pos
capture S5Q2 entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
> data get entity @e[tag=s5wh,limit=1] Pos
capture S5WB entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
sleep 15
> data get entity @e[tag=s5gs,limit=1] Pos
capture S5Q3 entity data: \[(-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d, (-?[\d.]+)d\]
shell python3 -c "import math; q0=({S5Q01},{S5Q02},{S5Q03}); q1=({S5Q11},{S5Q12},{S5Q13}); w=({S5WA1},{S5WA2},{S5WA3}); q2=({S5Q21},{S5Q22},{S5Q23}); w2=({S5WB1},{S5WB2},{S5WB3}); q3=({S5Q31},{S5Q32},{S5Q33}); print('30 m: moved', round(math.dist(q0,q1),1), 'whale dist', round(math.dist(q1,w),1)); print('12 m: dist at tp', round(math.dist(q2,w2),1), 'after 15 s', round(math.dist(q3,w2),1))"
