## SQ-PSM-09 | natural squid, glow squid and dolphin babies, 2-6 %
> setblock {S5O1} 64 {S5O3} minecraft:glass
> pbot spawn s5sq {S5O1} 65 {S5O3} minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 5
> kill @e[type=minecraft:squid]
> kill @e[type=minecraft:glow_squid]
> kill @e[type=minecraft:dolphin]
> scoreboard objectives add s5age dummy
> scoreboard objectives add s5n dummy
sleep 600
> execute as @e[type=minecraft:squid] store result score @s s5age run data get entity @s Age
> execute store result score #squid s5n if entity @e[type=minecraft:squid]
> execute store result score #squid_baby s5n if entity @e[type=minecraft:squid,scores={s5age=..-1}]
> scoreboard players get #squid s5n
> scoreboard players get #squid_baby s5n
> execute as @e[type=minecraft:glow_squid] store result score @s s5age run data get entity @s Age
> execute store result score #glow_squid s5n if entity @e[type=minecraft:glow_squid]
> execute store result score #glow_squid_baby s5n if entity @e[type=minecraft:glow_squid,scores={s5age=..-1}]
> scoreboard players get #glow_squid s5n
> scoreboard players get #glow_squid_baby s5n
> execute as @e[type=minecraft:dolphin] store result score @s s5age run data get entity @s Age
> execute store result score #dolphin s5n if entity @e[type=minecraft:dolphin]
> execute store result score #dolphin_baby s5n if entity @e[type=minecraft:dolphin,scores={s5age=..-1}]
> scoreboard players get #dolphin s5n
> scoreboard players get #dolphin_baby s5n
> ceperf mobcap
sleep 2
> pbot remove s5sq
> forceload remove {S5O1-48} {S5O3-48} {S5O1+48} {S5O3+48}
expect #squid has \d+ \[s5n\]
reject (Unknown (item|block|block type|entity)|does not (have|accept)|Incorrect argument for command|Unknown or incomplete command|That position is not loaded|No player was found|no such bot|no such item|Invalid (block state|tag)|\[(zq|s5)\] (error|no player))
